{
  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/458680302380c4f427fac22f6a77a8bf9393d8061f025663a87056784ce719c9ecff8d800085a16a0bb8393e107ff7692323a375f407356d1c2c82d098e04736\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/136099e98839247f966349aea53827ddac90542f9e0a18abbacb4f150d7356ae11d18e483acf35da3a4d7ec255cfdc5dee636fdb38fa3a48a9d97a2b34cab8aea85a4df24bd5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/24aea987a51fc9ee910e471bd02c1396cce8ad71726905b45ea7ce4272a7d017c09cc858b7fae14df15c7206628837580c37eb73e36a63c55a05a89c781e7ad2b8d916ca239eef594480c6830535c9bed828b56c3bb5d3bd4723bec1e7ef82c90c448b7a46ebd01cbf3cf66f7d177cb7ef396051e6f7e84b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4ec96b407dc3e241b7a5408e0f167ae8932c7fae1f46f23beeb7337bf5c1e1489fc03487d9ff0d2405fb9e7f14794876f86335e5a49601db507eec5a20c8015a55f8195b502cc217818410c1844847673215af465bfbc878be7dd0565c302763844443306ed84b736e2afbc093bac255a4802a243b3cc750\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/78d8e0403cf1a77f18fbc66cc6813723d26389d7861e4bbcebd2d291e068010d3ebae290e9d6bb7e9981d81f642cbb340d4aeccf8a315968ab52b8a3f52780fd383201390d81a91fbee4d6ad144a50629f6dbc511e7ef59db746fae519f7c7790bcef140fe900af61b9da4079adbc9adcfb5f9f543187309\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a4637770cdeab4cfa9b4c2d32b714e944c399a3d7d451113ba88ddd8f91590ac6ef1ee8b52f87357278c050967ed6db037f686e6c6896e2f3dea06774ac443069be97eaf51185b984aea2812689affa901698744b3fb4af85c28faf644a7b333b03df1728e868fd7562d68ba9b6fccb1a2ba1133f0da60e9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/13a147c940862f9e0e8ab4e97e7ab6c4f8d6008436d143a14aa70cbc606395c5fe3ac80d0857021f8682f194c6de1aca454a863be0660f227a92184c99384b286c6638ec19db295ea324903c9dad0c342f51e4142b85b65773dabf4944aef1475d082d615f679a4ed29781e96812a66ea1419486b064db87\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7c8e5214598a1ca4b477b1396bb85c8f42493dfbed070a89d8962c52217a5a65b40fd16423119b42c40f0510454b09859e49b4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e2fb2e05077ce447494d0e64978b059b0c0caf2c07b29b83ec6f8b66deb958abf10a8a75c1c5f34e2a6b696443a4b9b13fd64d2633f7a1d84663f7e5211c1b00befe69a4c43373c8ccdc5a6b6d30795c9a62b9a396da6ca0cf315177a984065da6b34b313c557456bedf770e49a1f8629116c08464891ccb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ab00334bfc1a866dcaeb935eec58413191a77f15ffae00a0474241a61517fc193d46d4a2bc366454eab3d554ea8f183bdbb1fc3faa5f54297eca2fb14305b6cfac4aa56a7f22f3d88a0c313f2e6826a2ec62b90dde4c71f3c03df58b98fb028e2149f7599ba4d49fbcf208241b0fe93d2b29d3cc173e36ab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ba4dabd2587fa86c7dcd52f50fde5fd09ae81f96c79afda37d8ca51edcc7b21eeef24bce4b3c121f63a0330527e1eda50108d976af5dd0f30c640c3e1305f8d0e426f0a2871fc9e6ae4575cb389e941efc2fd6ba1aa5aee95303480cbaba34f124f6193391e3c379aacc6bedb236293e587e3af3627b42c2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d0e72e5e60fd5554bd612220b77b035aa7f32fb584ac27896cc3e34e23878d58fe4681fad1b5f5177e83303ec3f95b374cb80a2fa57362d6a388f892c5c4b533352220a87ace9efd5a02188ef12e36885e0d8667d0fc67d2f4242e56a9e54c9fdffb7447bed83ee0391bb6812003f1d80246d97595c7050b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/493b271935f69eaea31cccb146291a3a66ada9068586e653faaa749f5f214337febf1086e08a086c8103af98283f09f1b5736f12f726b537cd4905b95ed9e84615440b68c693466dbd803894ebfff0747aa02c21e2fd91fb41fb49227e9062f4f7879d4735ad2d46d7880945bfde958c8fbf5b7083000dfa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6284cdce2a3e47812339b49e70d4fcb1aae64b19c95c0fdffe3adb298a6bcbbbab5127d466bfaf00d0693eab8629c18f468a2ba142e2cd60b4512133f070c2c11738bfe1a674bf477b5db438d417a660f9daf07246bbbaab24c765eabde34a0830cd4caf0c4d5095217183e2794a20701605348af2497215\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d1a88a86d51c3e3cdc909fc13c81a63cfe4a7699b8fdb52e50b20a95ca5a5fbb32e561a7a12f9e62baca90c1c2118cc81d83a04c5168ed4353b3e7488821478ccf7873d99b59946f48a617b2c51fdd1177c9801f69853a438fd418e7ac45384efeb4b28c32c07e8e5fdc835c5325b0fbb4a857c32bb6731c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3606f523f6fb3da41c76f17761e2bf4da3904bdc9562b86c85cb56f70af2f98d8c58824da8c2764a1ba7cdf36ab7d7aefc6cf2500a33fb5a38503ff76c3cbc755259f6c6e86cba905c8e5272358d06ede9272218c8c9aaa88a2406c60a7e2410b69d846fc3628fc1b3f321dec353770d1e6ce3efdbb1afef\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a9696dffdbc93e4b80fd3b3c7a5099836d00a40272c73caa4797e012d3e4b43e069d5725f44d21aa72fee77c69e815b5a81a00bffa04edfe69495d82dbd8f3ed571a8145f623c0f4205dce5faef99cb10da3d563ef69d56984ac1add8daef260b36a6443955981ead306f2b8df46a486b21d5507f68d3b21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b711618e5b0ca128adce81c5d568705bfc144bdcc22fc9ff4f0c6bd0f8b54a40d3e746c1d96fcf8875a119f07fb3d1edb947bfbb56db7a3d7fa1cb8f3de3f911e3e90a5f558abb599454913d0db2ba06c7b456e899348deb16cdcc816517e0fa2b8dacf8f725cf4abe6797cc7fc53d60b6ae52bb6142902a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d495fc4a173a438f3ef330a6c8dc87cf8d256dabdf9bc77c51e303127bd31b0d9a0da7fd5f058b53a43c699738a46be09e5f73306ae9202cf4e7ca579aef7d116579a0abddd9c0d6c99d31f443be54a31769690fc0e1db31143ba184604c483af1ee7c250a13ce603d40aa86bcc657eabacba4c3bf2d290b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f4eb8b1abfa7bbeedc9c60c1190142a1332fc38af9dd6f6f36bc46ccf7e88b31fca2e810f3abb4e9f6a2ff28015fd723fc4cfe0bda5749f848e2878bcbd7064c35e594d426960f0d3920bf1e88cf2feb46003e28c20c04704a0e5f75e801e49a696ae7923a977428f2b0c6a912d01c9607b331abd2143ee9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d489c368189f8a976892469476a02dca2eb1cf163b31561e4bf93c62a96ebd249ebffd1f202ded3c5d89b43c6cdc82afc298c1b42f21468ede164dfe824f274c993be97c98520f79075134ad8fcff77e22a645eec92b84bf2901083fc50b8b7fa78c6444432829f422cad397e4b8dc7f47d63d7bac08356b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dc2e12d5907e82f779f9412eaf85af2247ca3bcdb6956a14713ab54add8dc831c24e26fccc89a2ce58bfca00f52f53f08c8d454e32a6b890b1d9da9838bbb4a49ce891b8f990b48847ea3569e12159a77554fae0d3637a485e8f3f343730f6b07de60ff5c818d2c7a5674a193139fb7f05b725c262f2184e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c2785155e8085a7ff51580b15d3b367f562408e58146a115124675324123bd9a13ca72009516142e906bb3580973f2e5a34747dc797533add0f8f4fc2f4fbc8f71843cbd78d8778c698b27bec82b8644835506726cf80d473fa9f7fa290661626e949aab04a32bfc5a1e9d7ea0323d9e71476b98027097e1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/114093c6e9d3598e729816480a60d379400fe39f4859e4a3737e735ea2cfbe02c70c24056a1c6484884703d748486c129901ec4ec51419480192ce196b82903909247f217e3b2b172d122d8d6e53ac170888a2cdf93c264d0e04c850c4f38987f1b357f5ac79f43bd231abc5d2c0e525ee12880f1c34eed0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8f66d5908f22cd2e4dbb7c43f6b6aec8e14ac9ebfeb16a17314fd02ed0529f61ea42a052179c53e34e641fb8b6eb1ffe1e3dabaa8245d093c1d7356d630ec56228cd0daa6bcc30485e05b4daba382d96ab500731a8398b77b7632957ae660001a7cbe19bc176dfb9c73feb8ea0e7325cd7c44ce916f83152\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/338d6298c582b90c56f1e32c58125bce0d68b6784860f1f2279d1c105e702d47fa6cccdd7ba7e7ba2cc512ec3c7da73353bf12f685fa0f8c35463ab9e8d3275a58d470490756ae34559a0c4ce0b513d045ccc75756f2ceca78829a69ede97fa93362188f7d5db328eac383a60047502f1bef02d9beb9f1b6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/89dc27719b0def7590d78339a0193e93789836f0eea5d3378f57243059aa271bcf3663cc49b8bea6d2809c8d1b5f2fa40acc5b9addf76ed28c70a8db54cc6a664411b2884f2aa94ae9aacbc109db8b33b4131c9ff759177e8b391297e77e4b989f165e772eb3be818a19326f385bbdad0f3b629156cdba04\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fe2090af42c114162bcff574f91fcd0abac618639473e59771908a55855fa07da70ec870727e374656a6b39b9a26b14144b0ab4c6754998f98d8ca4765ca71c96af31705c573a73422aa23bc3a7a4700a5f2b27a182a1410c8e7ff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ce86a25b391c74bd0cfaa9e946c806e5d119671b1bdd88cd1df984442448e9e6975535d31f9c6e15b24acff8e7bd6ed45f701c5c6d752553f2741d4e55b6ab7af3597302130452fe09c1b78d2fec43a2561c05cc28375c6143f8b3ca9b5d4ff1778f60e4a4dda0deff1c6c2fecf8dc746809633a7a67fd16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/274aced8c4a4903b877cc7f74cdeb8b46aa7e13bae7b1b4fbd89389287a36f432f65cf290e6eb49ef392ec54c3605c5ecf74829dde74ebfbf6e6add4aed4b76ebe7628164ee0bec784523599c4a1dfa7c26de944aa08872a70196768926f085c01e02f35d2871c5e5326890020a75e6804237b937558d706\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e9c325878152612176ab602c1d64893b2645ec90db42b7240c073672d362b0f3d892ef7a05f08d78174078a1f0b471d19b762b28274dc8a6f9231fea8f6d075137e6e80581eac6e2c83a14fee7b658daa31c98a3ed86f625e32c8472947610b842bcb8f4e136723ec3bf862b1ee6ebf70d43a20648209d94\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/49aa1fc1985bb121a3524a968e1c0be41e9881d725de8f2b170016d819f12ee8f890bd242caeca634195763e90efda1d4ba634eb5e381fac05c3bee55bb0f8b2835382f2147fcf03575a0269824c008998827aac3b4f938da3ad0d364b044590bd84dad9188ef1e288d719e43e57c93b2e455fe9bfcdcd63\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/729098488a91c225bb8a1204b62fdce2ffecbb15411bbc23612b349ecddf3e62f85acda3bb6c78a916a2ce1ba051756980fa4060c81680528c5b2ae4997bcb464e3b6e1297f9c8214d2a607c6ccaa55a45b4f16f04c73e9b6b1b2a9c319d0d736eeb9e640d446b58568d467ba1789bbfc747923a0839ceb8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d121142789b9d0e6304462a05e72950312e669363640e55d1c1dc789bab895479e925fc5de98af3799b41eebcffb1f4a008bf7c847aae9a61dcf11aaa50e77a0e7780bf536509b785be605471612620ef6cb4ef5f5d5b171c902eb4216d3d2bc9f0979f9ed9f5805f212571c885308de6baeeb9779af3581\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/de5eaefd9095b551b3f5a80bf7fc86fbdf8963476ff3c2bb9f08e8ec67bbd9d656a182e027fdc91b5efa6bc7f051590b17bc988299b8caaaaa04479af34070d5b5ccacaca7a3c4cb054a08b1e0e495371443786255ac45c410b689151906aca76f71ec25dfa17dba501de907e6801952875909d6bfa1ddd8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
